        "## 11. Testing a String's Content\n",
        "\n",
        "Each returns `True` / `False`:\n",
        "- `isalnum()` → only letters & numbers?\n",
        "- `isalpha()` → only letters?\n",
        "- `isdigit()` → only digits?\n",
        "- `isidentifier()` → valid Python variable name?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
