        "## 14. Operations on Strings\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Arithmetic:** `+` joins, `*` repeats\n",
        "- **Relational:** compare with `==`, `!=`, `<`, `>` (uses Unicode order)\n",
        "- **Membership:** `in`, `not in`\n",
        "- **Looping:** go character by character"
