        "## ✅ Quick Recap\n",
        "\n",
        "- A string = a sequence of characters; reach into it with **indexing** `s[i]` and **slicing** `s[a:b:c]`.\n",
        "- Strings are **immutable** — every method returns a **new** string.\n",
        "- **Case:** `upper`, `lower`, `title`, `capitalize`, `swapcase`.\n",
        "- **Search:** `find` (returns -1), `index` (raises error), `count`, `startswith`, `endswith`.\n",
        "- **Build text:** `format()` and **f-strings**.\n",
        "- **Structure:** `split()` ↔ `join()`, plus `replace()` and `strip()`.\n",
        "- **Operators:** `+`, `*`, comparisons, `in` / `not in`, and looping.\n",
